# World 3's REAL transitions (the way tests/w1card.agk and w2over.agk cover worlds 1 and 2): world 1 -> world 2 -> world 3
# (mission 7, then 8 and 9 on the same map: the palettes patched into both lists, no rewrite), -> world 2 -> world 1 -> world 3.
# Each world's load replaces the previous world's art in the shared arena with the bitplanes off for two pictures, and
# world 3's strip fills under its card (1 column a picture behind a blank strip). No dropped frame anywhere.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
press fire 2
wait 120
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x04
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 525
wait 80
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x07
wait-serial "AGK world 3 loaded" 400
wait 90
screenshot m7card
press fire 2
wait 60
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x08
wait-serial "AGK start world=3 mission=8" 200
wait 90
screenshot m8card
press fire 2
wait 60
screenshot m8
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x09
wait-serial "AGK start world=3 mission=9" 200
wait 90
